ebook.com/DIUDSL\" style=\"color:#1877F2;\">       Facebook     </a>   </p>    <p>     <strong>Data Science Lab LinkedIn:</strong><br>     <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/data-science-lab-diu/\" style=\"color:#0A66C2;\">       LinkedIn     </a>   </p>    <!-- ID Card Form -->    <p>     Also, please fill out the following form for your Club ID Card:   </p>    <p>     <a href=\"https://forms.gle/qEtUNYwMWz5E9gCb6\"        style=\"color:#0A66C2; font-weight:bold;\">       Club ID Card Form     </a>   </p>    <p>     Please don't hesitate to reach out to any of the board members or advisors     if you have any questions or need assistance. We are here to help you make     the most of your membership.   </p>    <p>     Once again, welcome to our club, and we look forward to working with you.   </p>    <p>     For any queries or assistance, please visit     <strong>Lab 601, AB4.</strong>   </p>    <!-- Closing -->    <p style=\"margin-top: 25px;\">     <strong>Best Wishes</strong><br>     Data Science Club<br>     Daffodil International University   </p>  </div>",
